	(text "Holds the second firmware image (MCUboot slot 1, for over-the-air updates) and the art/fonts.\nThe nRF9151's own 1 MB flash holds the running app. Deep power-down between uses." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e74b317a-6cc3-49a0-bd21-70bef86c1d0c"))
	(text "WP# and RESET# tied to V3: single-I/O SPI only (4 wires), never write-protected in hardware.\nMISO is shared with the display's SDO - the display sheet must keep an unpowered panel\nfrom loading it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 226 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21a1fa61-a949-432b-81a6-3b156220466c"))
